<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;net8.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <Authors>Tuomas Hietanen</Authors>
    <Company>Welendus</Company>
    <PackageTags>Carmel Carmelsolutions .NET client bank integration payments online payment library transaction api us automation america united-states banking gateway ACH Wiretransfer debit credit SEC WEB PPD CCD</PackageTags>
    <Version>1.3.0</Version>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>v1.3.0:
- BREAKING: CarmelAccessToken.ToString() and string interpolation hide the token, so a header built from them sends "Bearer CarmelAccessToken hidden"; match CarmelAccessToken.Token to read it
- BREAKING: redirects are not followed; a 3xx is a failure
- BREAKING: parseWebhookResponse refuses a timestamp ahead by more than the tolerance, and a svix-signature entry that is not exactly v1,signature
- FIXED: a returned Async runs again, re-sending the request; createCreditTransfer keeps its key and date
- FIXED: createWebhookSubscription sends an Idempotency-Key derived from the endpoint and events, as Carmel documents for all POST requests
- ADDED: createWebhookSubscriptionWithKey takes the id the key is built from
- FIXED: createCreditTransfer and createWebhookSubscriptionWithKey refuse a blank id, which would share one Idempotency-Key
- FIXED: docs state that a createCreditTransfer retry after Carmel's 24 hours can send a second ACH
- CHANGED: approveCreditTransfer is documented as not safe to retry, as Carmel documents no key for PATCH; the library makes one attempt
- FIXED: cancelling the Async cancels its HTTP request
- FIXED: webhook signatures are compared in fixed time</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Description>
      Unofficial .NET client for Carmel integration, creating online payments via their API.
      Bank payment handling automation in the United States.
    </Description>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Thorium/CarmelNet.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageId>CarmelNet</PackageId>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Unlicense</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <IsTestProject>false</IsTestProject>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <PackageReadmeFile>Readme.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="Readme.md" Link="Readme.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <Compile Include="JsonData.fs" />
    <Compile Include="Carmel.fs" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="FSharp.Data" Version="8.1.11" />
    <PackageReference Include="FSharp.Data.JsonProvider.Serializer" Version="1.0.7" />
    <PackageReference Include="SwaggerProvider" Version="2.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="10.0.7" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Update="FSharp.Core" Version="10.1.201" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="CarmelOfflineTests" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
